<heading>list - List the runs of a topic.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  list TOPIC
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Lists the runs of the given topic in chronological order with
their ids, timestamps and entry counts. TOPIC may be an id or a
topic name.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
list "Roman Empire"
  List all runs of the topic.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
new, show
</paragraph>
